NAME
     tc - TC-11/TU56 DECtape

DESCRIPTION
     The files _t_a_p_0 ... _t_a_p_7 refer to the TC-11/TU56 DECtape
     drives 0 to 7.

     The 256-word blocks on a standard DECtape are numbered 0 to
     577.

